{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Are not mockers with me</b> — He is angry at his friends, for they are the mockers." "<b>and by their rebellion my eye dwells</b> — I do not sleep until they embitter my life. Or from סורר ומורה, as in כל איש אשר ימרה את פיך (every man who rebels against you)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:51.743919910Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}